.TH GRID-BENCHMARK 1 "July 2026" "Local Grid Suite v1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grid-benchmark \- Real-time LLM hardware telemetry and token throughput profiler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grid-benchmark
[\fI--model MODEL\fR] [\fI--tokens TOKENS\fR] [\fI--db PATH\fR] [\fI--list-models\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries local Ollama endpoints, executes streaming token generation benchmarks, logs low-level silicon kernel metrics (load time, prefill TPS, decode TPS) to SQLite, and prints post-run telemetry summaries.